{"type": "message", "id": "988b9dd5-dba3-41e1-8853-dae8fc47b731", "parentId": "a225cd94-7636-457d-8a36-22a04fb2d381", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T09:48:22.749Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call598bbc8781ce4fd482a8a8a49397fc4b", "toolName": "exec", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"schema\":\"wrd-source-text-chunks-v1\",\"source_ids\":[\"conv_d640957a9820\",\"conv_2ff337f34ddc\",\"conv_ce34559870b8\"],\"cursor_in\":\"0:0\",\"chunks\":[{\"source_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820\",\"message_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820:9ce6408c\",\"leaf_path\":\"\",\"leaf_sha256\":\"332592e20a1a03217e7be2cb700f7676fa31383bce5fa8cfe4006f5ba2ffb800\",\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":384,\"text\":\"请使用中文回复，除非用户明确使用其他语言。\\n\\n这个是昨天会议记录的录音，请帮我按照以前的格式继续整理，本次会议是关于世联行的，参会人员是林静、丁成英、闫熹钊；标的企业是上海世联行股权投资管理有限公司。\\n[附加文件: 会议决议2 (2).docx (/workspace/对话附件/会议决议2 (2).docx)]\",\"text_sha256\":\"332592e20a1a03217e7be2cb700f7676fa31383bce5fa8cfe4006f5ba2ffb800\"},{\"source_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820\",\"message_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820:38727dbd\",\"leaf_path\":\"\",\"leaf_sha256\":\"be37d927351ec7ee8c683e7b8a34c67afce0749afa342a665b022575a16fbe63\",\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":148,\"text\":\"收到，我先翻一下以前的会议记录格式，再整理这份世联行的会议记录 📂\\n\\n我先看看附件内容和历史成果文件。\",\"text_sha256\":\"be37d927351ec7ee8c683e7b8a34c67afce0749afa342a665b022575a16fbe63\"},{\"source_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820\",\"message_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820:eec88283\",\"leaf_path\":\"\",\"leaf_sha256\":\"fbc83854ba1a621abb6c8bd442e663c161c545b76afaa8a76bfb87e33a4aa0dc\",\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":69,\"text\":\"找到了以前的会议纪要相关会话，我看下具体格式。\",\"text_sha256\":\"fbc83854ba1a621abb6c8bd442e663c161c545b76afaa8a76bfb87e33a4aa0dc\"},{\"source_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820\",\"message_id\":\"conv_d640957a9820:d901be9e\",\"leaf_path\":\"\",\"leaf_sha256\":\"acd3cd8b318cedb0afb3e068db5a826b5420d35c135640f6e097a00cfe371b34\",\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":142,\"text\":\"明白了，我按以前的会议纪要格式来整理。先确认一下之前文档的排版细节（字体/编号），保证风格一致。\",\"text_sha256\":\"acd3cd8b318cedb0afb3e068db5a826b5